@* =================================================================================================
   FILE: Maroos.Web/Components/Account/Pages/ResetPasswordConfirmation.razor URL: /Account/ResetPasswordConfirmation
   ORIGIN: generated by the Blazor Identity template; Maroos uses it unchanged.
   PURPOSE: After a successful password reset: a link to log in with the new password.
   ================================================================================================= *@
@page "/Account/ResetPasswordConfirmation"
<PageTitle>Reset password confirmation</PageTitle>

<h1>Reset password confirmation</h1>
<p role="alert">
    Your password has been reset. Please <a href="Account/Login">click here to log in</a>.
</p>
